{"id":"grupo","lemma":"grupo","pos":"noun","rank":471,"glosses":["group","party, team, crew, gang, squad, (when interchangeable with \"group\")","cluster, bunch, clump, pool, grouping, lot, batch"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɾupo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"grupos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-grupo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me encanta tu grupo.","en":"I love your outfit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448975"},{"text":"Manteneos en grupos pequeños.","en":"Keep in small groups.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1058257"},{"text":"Es el grupo de Tom.","en":"It's Tom's group.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/152870"},{"text":"Fueron separados en dos grupos.","en":"They were separated into two groups.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594253"},{"text":"No está en nuestro grupo.","en":"He's not in our group.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636500"}]}